        "Ongoing anti-VEGF maintenance dosing, q4-8 weeks indefinitely -- this loop has no exit",
        "back to a treatment-free monitoring-only state and no lifetime injection cap; it runs for",
        "the rest of the patient's life (or until Maintenance_GA_Development ends active treatment)."
